  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An echo is proficient in simple weapons. They are also proficient in all weapons, armor, and shields that they have seen used by a proficient character in the past 24 hours. Additionally, an echo can automatically activate any magic or psionic item he or she has seen activated in the last 24 hours. For these effects the echo has a caster or manifester level equal to their echo class level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/echo#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
